      {
        "id": 9778,
        "title": "Ambito globale",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Global scope 1",
            "id": 86994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili create al di fuori di un blocco di funzione hanno un <strong>ambito globale</strong>, come <code>shipping</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>shipping</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una variabile creata fuori da una funzione ha <strong>ambito globale</strong>, quindi la funzione può leggerla. Crea <code>shipping</code> con valore <code>10</code> per stampare <code>64</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"cart\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>shipping</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Global access",
            "id": 86995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con un ambito globale, possiamo <strong>accedere</strong> in sicurezza alla variabile in qualsiasi punto del codice, come abbiamo fatto con <code>shipping</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"64\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>shipping</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Global scope 2",
            "id": 86996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tutte le variabili hanno ambito globale, tranne quelle create all'interno delle funzioni, come player_1 qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>player_1</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un blocco <code>if</code> non è una funzione, quindi qui <code>player_1</code> mantiene un ambito globale. Impostalo su <code>\"Mario\"</code> per stampare <code>Player 1: Mario</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"single_player\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Luigi&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>player_1</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Access after creating",
            "id": 86997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche con un ambito globale, è importante poter accedere alle variabili solo dopo averle create, come qui con <code>character</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(character)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>character = \"Mario\"</code>, seguito da <code>print(character)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche una variabile globale può essere usata solo dopo essere stata creata.</p><p>Salva <code>\"Mario\"</code> in <code>character</code>, copiane il valore in <code>message</code>, poi visualizza <code>message</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"character\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message = &quot;character&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(&quot;message&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>character = \"Mario\"</code>, seguito da <code>message = character</code> e infine <code>print(message)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Global scope 1",
            "id": 87041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali variabili hanno uno scope globale?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Variabili create al di fuori del blocco di una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tutte le variabili</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Variabili create al di fuori del blocco di una funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili create al di fuori del blocco di una funzione hanno ambito globale.</p><p>La riga <code>theme = \"dark\"</code> appare prima di qualsiasi definizione di funzione. Quale ambito ha <code>theme</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ambito globale</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ambito locale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ambito del parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Ambito globale.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Global access",
            "id": 87042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Da dove possiamo accedere a una variabile con ambito globale?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Da qualsiasi punto del codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo all'interno delle funzioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Da qualsiasi punto del codice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi accedere a una variabile globale da qualsiasi punto del codice.</p><p>Imposti la variabile globale <code>tax = 5</code>. Una funzione restituisce <code>price + tax</code>. Cosa restituisce passando <code>10</code> come <code>price</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>15</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code>, perché la funzione ignora le variabili esterne.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un errore, perché <code>tax</code> è stata creata fuori dalla funzione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Questions: Global scope 2",
            "id": 87043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale tipo di ambito hanno le variabili create all'interno di condizioni e cicli?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Locale</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Globali, perché non vengono creati all'interno delle funzioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Locale.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le condizioni e i cicli non creano un nuovo ambito locale in Python.</p><p>Un ciclo <code>while</code> di primo livello crea <code>attempts = 1</code> nel suo blocco. Quale ambito ha <code>attempts</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ambito globale, perché il ciclo non crea un nuovo ambito</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ambito locale, perché l'assegnazione è rientrata nel ciclo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nessun ambito finché il ciclo non termina</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ambito globale, perché il ciclo non crea un nuovo ambito.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access after creating",
            "id": 87044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando possiamo accedere per la prima volta a una variabile, indipendentemente dall'ambito?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo dopo averlo creato</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima o dopo averlo creato</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solo dopo averlo creato.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indipendentemente dall'ambito, possiamo accedere a una variabile soltanto dopo averla creata.</p><p>Quale ordine visualizza <code>10</code> senza errori?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Prima <code>score = 10</code>, poi <code>print(score)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima <code>print(score)</code>, poi <code>score = 10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Soltanto <code>print(score)</code>, perché la stampa crea la variabile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Prima <code>score = 10</code>, poi <code>print(score)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Global scope 1",
            "id": 87045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea <code>rent</code> all'esterno della funzione, in modo che abbia uno scope globale.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rent = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(groceries)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Total: \" /><text value=\"{rent + groceries}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rent: \" /><text value=\"{rent}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rent: 1000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Total: 1300\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>rent</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea <code>rent</code> fuori dalla funzione affinché possano leggerla sia la funzione sia il print esterno. Impostala su <code>1000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rent = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(groceries)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Total: \" /><text value=\"{rent + groceries}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rent: \" /><text value=\"{rent}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rent: 1000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Total: 1300\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>rent</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
